=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes gateway stop </span><span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"token plain\"> hermes gateway start</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">🔐 Pairing code: XKGH5N7P</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Send this code to the bot owner for approval.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes pairing approve telegram XKGH5N7P</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># See all pending and approved users</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes pairing list</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Revoke someone&#x27;s access</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes pairing revoke telegram </span><span class=\"token number\">987654321</span><span class=\"token plain\